# The SDK bundle is COPIED from ../../dist by `pnpm copy`, which `prestart`
# runs before every `pnpm start`. It is a build artifact, not source.
#
# It used to be committed, and that is exactly how this example came to ship a
# two-major-stale bundle teaching a retired credential prefix: nothing rebuilt
# it and nothing checked it. A generated file that is regenerated on every run
# cannot drift; a generated file in git can only drift.
ship.js
